      "writtenOn": "2023-06-14T11:15:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do you suggest to move UNFROZEN event handling in non handler thread?\nI agree we can mitigate the race issue by that.\nBut we still have issue if the app is unfrozen while destroyLiveTcpSocketsByOwnerUids is closing the sockets.\nAlso, even if we don’t have the race, if the app is unfrozen after we close the sockets, app could have a user-visible delays or user-visible errors.\nSo, If we face this race issue frequently, I think that mean the freezer is too aggressive.\nI think current our code (immediate socket closing you wrote and this CL) assumes that once the apps are frozen, not many apps are unfrozen soon.",
